      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems reasonable, as long as we can make sure we don\u0027t impact performance greatly. If it is, we could also consider limiting this functionality to when running in a json-module-graph or similar mode\n\nThe other consideration here (and in general with changing an API) is that partners can use our exported APIs, so it it hard to remove, but instead have to have a parallel API.\n\nHardcoding names doesn\u0027t greatly concern me as it\u0027s also hard-coded in every .bp file but it is more toilsome and would require parallel apis.",
